uctivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (9/10).","financial_summary":["Absci Corporation is a small-cap healthcare business with a $1.5B market cap on $3M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at -21% over the past three years, and a shrinking top line is the hardest headwind any business can overcome.","Returns on capital run at -69% against a 11% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The company is burning through $94M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, thin -575.7\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Net dilution runs at 7.3% annually, transferring value from owners to stock-based comp, and stock-based comp at 654% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insiders hold 12% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (25.4% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Revenue growth in the bottom decile of Healthcare peers \u2014 losing share inside the profit pool","sev":"red","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Operating margins 4297% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Patent cliffs, drug-pricing reform, and reimbursement pressure \u2014 a single regulatory change can reset the pricing power that justifies the multiple.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Clinical trial concentration risk \u2014 binary FDA outcomes on a lead asset can wipe out billions in market cap in a single session.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"GLP-1 disruption across sub-sectors \u2014 weight-loss drugs are reshaping demand for orthopaedics, cardiovascular devices, and sleep-apnea treatments in ways not yet priced in.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Valued at a 173% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Large open-market insider purchases (net $0.6M) \u2014 management putting its own capital behind the business","Healthcare sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 13% over 3 months","Healthcare ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average","Strong 6-month sector performance (30.7% return)"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Absci (ABSI) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"fool.com","link":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/12/absci-absi-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/?source=iedfolrf0000001","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794502440.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.226,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Absci Corporation (ABSI) Reports Q3 Loss, Misses Revenue Estimates","source":"zacks.com","link":"https://www.zacks.com/stock/news/3028426/absci-corporation-absi-reports-q3-loss-misses-revenue-estimates?cid=CS-ZC-FT-fundamental_analysis%7Cyseop_template_4-3028426","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794486901.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.494,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Absci Q3 2026 Earnings Preview (NASDAQ:ABSI)","source":"seekingalpha.com","link":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4670715-absci-q3-2026-earnings-preview","date":"2026-11-11","timestamp":1794412881.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,